Hardware notes: front-panel audio pinout and related connectors.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Open Source License<\/strong> \u2014 Open-source license.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>LLM<\/strong> \u2014 LLM notes: LangChain JSON mode and prompting.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Machine Learning<\/strong> \u2014 Machine learning notes: terms, CNNs for image classification, and links.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Microservices<\/strong> \u2014 Microservices notes: architecture types, components, event sourcing, and saga.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>NFC<\/strong> \u2014 NFC notes: MIFARE DESFire UID, keys, and file structure.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Privacy<\/strong> \u2014 Privacy notes: generating a policy.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Proxy<\/strong> \u2014 Proxy notes: WPAD autodiscovery over DHCP and DNS.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>RSS<\/strong> \u2014 RSS notes: FeedBurner as a filter in front of the original feed.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Software<\/strong> \u2014 Software notes: versioning, a bootable Windows ISO, and what a solid developer looks like.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><strong>Web<\/strong> \u2014 Web notes: CSS, SSL, SEO, caching, sitemaps, and site setup.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/algorithms' data-target='computer\/technology\/algorithms' data-title='Algorithms'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/computer\/technology\/algorithms.jpg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/algorithms\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Algorithms<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\